# Every checkout has LF text files, whatever core.autocrlf says (Git for
# Windows sets it to true): the formatter and byte-level tests expect LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Test fixtures are byte-exact (State generations, CURRENT pointers, manifests
# with digests, legacy review sources): never convert their line endings, even
# where Git for Windows sets core.autocrlf=true.
packages/workspace/test/fixtures/** -text
